# What Cloudflare must NOT upload.
#
# The deploy runs `wrangler deploy` with the assets directory set to the repo
# root, so without this it uploads the repository itself -- including .git,
# whose pack file is 46.8 MiB against a 25 MiB per-asset limit. That is the
# error this file exists to fix, and it fails the build rather than shipping
# something broken, which is the good version of that problem.
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore. Everything not listed here ships.

# The repository and the tooling around it.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.claude
.DS_Store
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.toml

# 54 MB of engine recordings, untracked and sitting on disk. Not part of the
# game -- the samples it actually plays live in assets/audio/.
engine-audio-master

# Written for whoever is working on this, not for whoever is playing it.
README.md
docs

# Development tools. The physics suite and the track editor are how the game
# gets made, not part of it; the measurement tool likewise. Delete a line here
# to put any of them back on the public site.
test.html
test
editor.html
tools
